      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-09-30_WidnesExaminer_art0008" n="art0008">
        <head>LORD</head>
        <p>LORD</p>
        <p>The Committee of Invite TENDERS for the Supply of HOUSE COAL and 'SLACK from the 14th October, 1916, for a period of three; _six, or twelve months.</p>
        <p>Tenders' must be made upon forms, which can be obtained on application being made to the undersigned, and must be delivered at the Hospital not later than. 9 a.m. on Wednesday, 11th .October, addressed the Chairman of . the Visiting Committee, and endorsed !"renders for House Coal and Slack." The Committee do not bind themselves to accept the lowest or any tender, and reserve to themselves the right to accept or rejecq the whole or part of any tender. By order,,</p>
        <p>P. IRVING DUTTON, Clerk and Stewal (1.</p>
