      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-09-30_WidnesExaminer_art0014" n="art0014">
        <head>FU • RY</head>
        <p>FU • RY</p>
        <p>FAc HIONS.</p>
        <p>IT\ is, indeed, a pleasing fact that the Furs and Fur Coats of to-day combine utility and beauty to a marked degree. No more practical garment than the Natural Musquash Coat has ever been devised for Winter wear. Our present collection provides every Lady with an ideal choice.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-09-30_WidnesExaminer_art0015" n="art0015">
        <head>AND AS TO PRICE</head>
        <p>AND AS TO PRICE</p>
        <p>it may be safely said that the cost of a Fur Coat will ndt unduly strain the resources of the most finely adjusted dress allowance. We ask you to put this to the proof by a personal inspection of. the new Coats and at the same time to loop through the latest ideas in Fur Sets. Skunk, Skunk Opossum, Fox, Wolf, Ermine, Musquash, Squirrel, and Coney Furs are all ,approved by Fashion, and never has the intrinsic value of even, the least expensive skins reached a higher standard than that of this. Season. AU our Furs are carefully chosen, andlin quality and kind each beautiful Pelt is thoroughly dependable.</p>
      </div>
