      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-09-30_WidnesExaminer_art0029" n="art0029">
        <head>EXAMINER, SATURDAY, SEPTEMBER 30, 191 G.</head>
        <p>THE EXAMINER, SATURDAY, SEPTEMBER 30, 191 G.</p>
        <p>Wounded</p>
        <p>was formerly employed by Messrs. Rylands, Bros., Ltd. He is an old boy of Heathside School, and was a bugle t in the St. Paul's Com- pany of the Church Lads' Brigade. The ti'. brothers who have been wounded are Riflemts.,. Herbert Smart, King's Royal Rifles, and Private Albert Smart, Royal Welsh Fusiliers, who is at present ,in hospital at York.</p>
        <p>Iltti'llll;:rijg..7.::'ll4L:';'?...li:rr:;?;l!:iti':::i: 4:14:-:Ai .ken.i:;o..t . ..SWIEWISkV:.,-,..:4'4',NV:0004:.;4wm,'1::iqE.4k - 404•040,-- '. ''.:.V4oo4aagft.gii.lii:Aii ~..NvkAmv.ve..4:..wa, biiigiftvaid N.--Ai1y.,.:;.,,,.,.:,].:q.114x-Aiittne•ii,:it e.-•%.A*:ihtx*;l: .0.:?,,,,iiiitg,,A,,,,,065: - :,iii;:,:::::',s-(..,4;;,..?;:m.-v,,,vviit.i:pi 72k:ftweAftt:i- .•••••:.:Vv.z:'.s•..•.*,.;:..::wkisawiepm::.: • 4,oitzlikipftm. „..,...... ...-:- .. ••••••••• ".!-:-..itaIRROVAR. ,:g.?&lt;.:..:5k,g:::5:30::.•,:,,i,ii,:. .:.:.. .. ... 4fi-wq,,,. imi.zlE...iv.a::.ii,::-;:i:i.:: .410,..,i. ....,.. ~...,..., , ~,,,,,,,,,,,,,, Matimti.vi.. -:..,;-.•:-:..:::: i;,..,::...:-.::-•,:i.i:,.„.f..:0.E&amp; 0-',4l,im:g;.; ilalgtiZ's.M. :-.:-:,..:•-•i!,::: -::;.,. :'...dw.":" .:AkiiiWtOtg 1-g-Age:ANW:a " . -.:-:::::g.,,:s....:*ziii:AniEmg.i:a.N.: . vv.: - -". v.wx?:tm:i.. ?....?gro!*,, ...0,...„ ttivoif*iftiltii , *E?.*fm:,-;3.**: • ?:::i:ia'•:ii% ~.:.;.i.&amp;:iiil:..;:,::::4,i;•:Aiik.,,,iMi 0Awi*.::.:,:3.::.v-fgw.!tami,. 11,41.21,,,„,,, .41.10.0•00..5h. , - :Atz,,,,,-:„.., .:::,,,,,:,,:,,,,,..e.„,,,,,,,,,,,,,„„:„,,::::w,,,,:,,, ...1...,5*,,,,wr.::, ...,:p::::::,]$0,......„:::::::::,.:1:,,:,:::::::, %;&gt;zeoA .oUi&amp;•o4:l:l:izi,i.q:,-,Nwl.::::0-Ai Arkatt*SK. w ogfini.gatZ:Megiftini* . o,w,:::oo%*ar*ieU: •g-AV:k.:SVIIM44O34:NtIONW: E .morigimit.f.,ooANNEkei.4.-k; BASMOSAlRCRtignittagibitir. Grogiitg::l':i :,,woMeMeNtgArffigatignoribe ...gnsaft*k 'lgniitgrietßOMlSt illitt.giio7%ol4ol4:Wite italiglit ~:504.4:04r.'...1'00113:*. ailitttak. Ogtrifidtln, IP 4 Ittmos::qikmva 01,.. -'..;:farlmilt.az.VglasVOKK4inoml ' :417i0:426....40.0Kv0gieffit0n. 4.,,ingfiNviug .......,:.07:::,.....vv,:,......, .... . .</p>
        <p>PRIVATE HAROLD SMART.</p>
