        <p>B LACKPOOL.— All classes of Servants Wanted; Blackpool. St. Annes and Lytham; enclose stamp.—Select Registry, 91, Church-street, Blackpool. CAPABLE WOMAN Wanted as Housqlreeper ; one with experience in domestic service pre- ferred; no washing; 3 in family; good wages (pro- gressive) to suitable person; references.—Caress, 9, Moss-road, Winnington, Northwich. (NOOK-GENERAL and House-Parlourmaid V Wanted; small family; good wages and out- ings; non-basement, 9-roomed house.—Mrs. Binnie, 44, Platts-lane, Hampstead, London. (NOOK-GENERAL (good,. plain) Wanted; two V in family; three maids.—Apply Mrs. Raschen, The Highlands, Runcorn</p>
